03-05
00:02:11.408 --> 00:02:15.696
Start a timer so you can report your actual study time later.

03-06
00:02:15.876 --> 00:02:20.057
The table follows worksheet order, not video timestamps.

03-07
00:02:20.237 --> 00:02:27.512
Work through the process review and solubility calculation, then the
